WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Rep: Thanks for looping in your infrastructure lead today. I wanted to get
more precise numbers before we model this out.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Infrastructure Lead: Sure. When we actually pulled the full device inventory,
including clinical workstations and the mobile cart fleet, we landed at 9,400
endpoints, not 6,000. That first number was just corporate IT.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Rep: Good to know — that's a meaningful difference. And on staffing costs?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Infrastructure Lead: Fully loaded, we budget about 145,000 per analyst
including benefits and on-call pay.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Rep: That's helpful. Anything on the licensing side you can share?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Infrastructure Lead: We're paying somewhere around 380,000 a year across the
overlapping tools the Security Director mentioned last time.
